      "product_summary": "Stretch Fabric Upper: Flexible textile construction for casual walking styles. | Slip-On Design: Simple on-and-off construction for everyday use. | Lightweight EVA Sole: Supports a light casual walking shoe structure. | Solid Color Options: Suitable for wholesale assortment planning. | Factory Support: Mixed sizes, colors, samples, packing and OEM/ODM requirements can be discussed for the current order.",
